  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-5">
    <td>Type 2 diabetes on metformin, A1c 7.4%</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>E11.65</td><td>S — Synthetic; diabetes is documented only in his last years (D), and placing it at 57 is a synthetic choice.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-6">
    <td>Chronic pain in the back, hips, pelvis and knees after dozens of fractures from stunt crashes, including a broken pelvis; ibuprofen stopped, and managed without oral NSAIDs or opioids</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>G89.29</td><td>S — Synthetic pain at the index age, anchored to his documented fractures and the pain of his later years.</td>
